### Proteins {.text-center .fg-red}

##### Chemical Composition &amp; Building Blocks

&gt; `CHON-S` ▪️ `proteins-&gt;amino acids` ▪️ `20 amino acids`

* **Elemental Structure:** Proteins consist of `CHON-S` carbon, hydrogen, oxygen, and nitrogen, with sulfur occasionally present.
* **Digestion &amp; Units:** During digestion, proteins break down into `amino acids`, which serve as the ++fundamental structural units++ of protein. 
*  The human body contains `20 distinct` types of amino acids.
